  "description": "Data history: The Osprey Nest Platform locations were collected using the District's GPS unit on 2021-05-14 for the Osprey Permit Program. As the location was taken at the base of the platform pole, the elevation attribute is for ground level and not the nest itself. The data was initially added into the system by the GIS& Database Administrator on 2021-06-10.\nAccuracy/ spatial tolerance: \u00b15cm \nOriginal Spatial Reference of the GPS points: UTM with NAD83 datum, Zone 11, Meter; Central Meridian 117d W\nUpdate frequency: Periodically, as needed",
